From: Foxes Hung <foxes687@andestech.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Nov 2023 17:14:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 128/241] target/riscv: Support FP_MODE for dynamic BF16/FP16
 mode switch with zfh/zvfh half-precision floating-point extension
 instructions

Signed-off-by: Foxes Hung <foxes687@andestech.com>
---
